"\"• Mastodon Buffers: Followers, Following, Blocked, Muted, Ads and Trends.\\n\"\n"
"\"• Lists, saved searches and server filters.\\n\"\n"
"\"• Spell checker and autocomplete mentions when writing.\\n\"\n"
"\"• Play YouTube/SoundCloud audio from a link.\\n\"\n"
"\"• Configurable output device and sound packages.\\n\"\n"
"\"• Minimize to system tray.\\n\"\n"
"\"Refer to the manual (F1) for more details."

