"\"Public uses your visibility by default, and a more private one maintains that privacy.\"\n"
"\"With the other option your answers do not appear on the public line. In both cases\"\n"
"\"You can change the privacy in the composer before publishing."

msgid ""
"Recibe las novedades al instante mediante streaming, sin pedirlas cada X segundos. \"\n"
"            \"Si tu instancia no tiene streaming, se usa automáticamente el intervalo de abajo. \"\n"
"            \"Desactívalo si quieres un intervalo fijo para no cargar instancias pequeñas."
