"\"changes take effect (templates define the columns of each buffer).\\n\\n\"\n"
"\"Do you want to reboot now to apply the changes?\\n\\n\"\n"
"\"Yes: changes are applied when the application is restarted.\\n\"\n"
"\"No: the templates are left as they were (the changes are discarded)."

